  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "還好在廢城好好準備運動了一下。你們這點人連飯渣都算不上，別說小菜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "你！羅德島這種感染者的敗類，就這樣幫著龍門坑害同胞？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "把我們留給龍門是不是就不會髒自己的手？虛偽！感染者的恥辱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "被按在地上揍了兩拳還有多餘力氣放狠話，真行啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "不過你又搞錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "喘不過氣了？是不是感覺連肺都要燒起來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "呃，呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "先是鼻腔，然後是氣管，最後是胸腔。我的這根手指，只要再這麼輕輕一動......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "高溫氣流就會立即竄進你的身體，膨脹，點燃你的器官，從你的毛孔裡噴出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "其實龍門還可能饒你們一命。我真要動手的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "哈，哈......唔！呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "你們一個都活不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "不不不不要！放，放開我！救命！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "行啦，我不會做那麼過火的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "警員！過來。交給你處理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "對了，烏薩斯人，剛才那不叫動手。那是順手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#7",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "啊，終於來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#7",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，這邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "剛才那招太漂亮了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "哈，小意思。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "下次讓你看點更厲害的，那招“在不弄斷骨頭的情況下把手臂反折九十度”怎麼樣？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "噫，你怎麼那種表情......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "你在羅德島也有段時間了吧，難道沒見過幾個會打架的人嗎？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "跟他們比起來，我算心慈手軟的了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "鬧得還真大啊。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "那肯定，你看我像那種藏著捏著幹活的人嗎？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "要是能把他們嚇破膽，不過多久其他人就會不攻自破了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "而且不把場面弄大點，不覺得對不起自己累出的一身汗嗎？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "別給博士灌輸這些呀......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#7",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "小兔子！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "也別一見面就把我抱起來啊！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#7",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "怎麼會有這麼軟的臉蛋......怎麼會！別掙扎嘛，讓我再多摸摸，又不會少塊肉！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "煌......憋囁叻筷廳嚇！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#7",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "哎。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我們才分別行動不到一個小時，你這是什麼反應啊！嚴肅點！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#7",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "真是不可愛的小孩。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我受夠了......！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#10",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "不，別，我只是在開玩笑！可別再往我腦袋裡塞些什麼奇怪的情緒了，那種懲罰吃一次都嫌多了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "等等。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "你身邊那位？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "灰喉",
          "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1",
          "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
          "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
          "text": "你好，我是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "我知道你是誰。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "下次你再對我們感染者同胞說那種話，我會撕掉你半張臉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "煌！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "對不起，阿米婭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "但我還是要警告她，而且絕不會改口。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "灰喉",
          "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
          "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "先走了。下處目標點會合。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "灰喉，煌她可能誤會了你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "灰喉",
          "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
          "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
          "text": "不要緊。畢竟我真的說過那些話。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "她沒理由用那時的事情去批評現在的你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "灰喉",
          "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1",
          "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
          "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
          "text": "誰知道呢，我真的改變看法了嗎？我自己也不知道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所以你更要做些什麼了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "那你現在參與行動，真的好嗎？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "灰喉",
          "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1",
          "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
          "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
          "text": "我就是因為想做些什麼才來的，不管那位煌幹員怎麼說，怎麼做。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "欸......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（阿米婭......）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "（嗯......作為非感染者，羅德島現在的處境可能會讓灰喉她感到迷茫。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "（這次行動，也許能讓她做出決定......無論是離開還是留下。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "（但她習慣了服從命令，很少表露自己的想法，有時候也會口出驚人......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "（她的情感裡沒有惡意。她只是需要機會認清自己。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "（不過她的實力非常可靠，博士你可以信任她。雖然我們不一定能幫到她，但她一定能幫到你。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "咦......嘉維爾去哪了？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "按捺不住衝動，去毆打敵人了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她可能想造成些不必要的破壞。",
          "value": "3",
