          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "這，不好了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "不對，是誰向博士你這麼評價她的，有些過分，雖然事實也確實如此......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "但我們確實不能在這個時間點出差錯。趕快去下個巡邏點向她發送聯絡信號吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "即使她的行動都在規劃之內，但沒人監督的話，還是會造成很可怕的後果......"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "其他的小隊呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "其他小隊有精英幹員們代為指揮，他們也會向我們報告戰況的，放心吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "現在，我們已經處於聯合作戰中最關鍵的一環。這會是龍門決定性的一戰。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "陳警司呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "她有自己的指揮任務。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "依照我們和近衛局的規劃，作為特別督查組的組長，陳警司將帶領近衛局的精銳部隊，盡可能地阻擋整合運動的進攻性力量。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "一方面，她要“引導”整合運動主要部隊的行動方向，逼迫他們前往指定位置；另一方面，她也要盡力阻止其他整合運動小隊進入貧民區。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "而羅德島會沿各個巡邏點前進，在行進過程中幫助近衛局其他隊伍消滅殘餘的整合運動，促使整合運動放棄戰鬥。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "最後，我們會到達預定地點，貧民區和近衛局一同擊潰整合運動的主力部隊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "在這種規模的行動中，羅德島能做的不多，但我們會盡力完成合約內容。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "至於一些我們和近衛局之間的合作問題......Dr.{@nickname}，我保證會給羅德島的各位一個答覆。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "不過博士，有件事，也許只有你能做到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "交給我了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "嘿嘿，嗯，"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "嗯......不過，也不是那種強求你去努力表現自己的事。"
