        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "尤其是現在。我們和龍門間的合作已經出現了一些隔閡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "雖然煌是羅德島賴以生存的精英作戰幹員之一，心理要素卻也會在一定程度上影響她的發揮。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "正因為她堅定地站在我們這邊，感染者的遭遇才更有可能左右她的情感狀態。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
