        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "現在也不叫“並肩作戰”。這該叫“不得已的合作”。你是怎麼從廢城回來的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "我當然有自己的機動配給啦，否則怎麼去救羅德島？你是不是在鬧彆扭啊，一副氣鼓鼓的樣子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "嗯，讓我想想。"
        },
