          "speakerName": "陳",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "啊，對。背著我營救羅德島這件事，你可以私下裡告知我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "你是覺得臉上無光，還是覺得自己被蒙在鼓裡了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "都有。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "......怎麼回事，你什麼時候變這麼坦誠了？我以前認識的陳警官，嘴上可是要繞好幾圈——"
