          "text": "你們已經就位了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "對，沒錯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "我知道。只是，近衛局有他們該做的事，你們有你們該做的，這不算越俎代庖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "確實。林舸瑞是很反對。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "但這件事，由不得他！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "各方的意見我都收到了。我們沒有選擇餘地，這也是無奈之舉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "舸瑞的女兒會聯絡你們。此後三周以內，絕不要聯繫我，一切資訊交她保管。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "就交給你們了。不用擔心身後，我會一直看著你們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "......不必再用這個稱呼。往事只是往事，我與往事再無瓜葛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "嗯，望龍門長治久安。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "老魏，我們是那個......你們怎麼說來著，結義兄弟？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "所以，她和我女兒，拜託你了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哎，感覺和你說這些是多此一舉。你總不能連自己的妹妹也照顧不好吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "女兒的名字我已經取好了，就叫......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......塔露拉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "別太放在心上。我全明白。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我全都明白。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
